##🧪 Live Demo on Wokwi (No Setup Required)
Access our public simulation on Wokwi:

🔗 VitalSpace AI Wokwi Simulator

Click the Play (▶) button to start the simulation.

Open the Serial Monitor set to 115200 baud to observe live telemetry.

Perform your stress tests:

Nominal/Safe State: Keep SpO2 high, radiation low, and MPU6050 at rest (Z: 1g). You will see the Green LED turn on and the display show ESTADO: OPTIMO.

Warning State: Adjust radiation to mid-range (15-30 mSv) or lower SpO2 to 92%. The Yellow LED will turn on, emitting a pulse every 2 seconds.

Simulate Impact or Emergency: Set MPU6050 acceleration to >2.5g or drop SpO2 below 90%. The system will switch to IMPACTO / CAIDA or ALERTA CRITICA, activating the Red LED and continuous alarm.

